Your kernel is about the right size, but your X server is way too large
(Mine is 10M right now).  You should add the following lines to your
xdm-config file:

DisplayManager._0.terminateServer:   true
DisplayManager.local_0.terminateServer:      true


This will cause your Xserver to terminate and restart every time you log
out - which stops the upward creaping memory usage.

Darcy


