	i[34]86	CMUmach	n		n

The Hot Port List (in decreasing order of priority):

	Snake	HP-UX
	Mac	MacOS	(does any of this make sense on the Mac?)
	RS6k	AIX	(had it working for 3.1.5 :-( ).

I know nothing about the Amiga, Windows or NT.

Any thoughts, comments, code, offers to pool effort would be
greatfully appreciated.  The system we've built is free (not sure
which copyright model we're going to use, but it will be freely
available), as are all of the subsystems of it (like the one I'm
