>Hello there!
>I have a set of programs that I am trying to port to OSF-1 from ULTRIX.
>I am no "X" wizzard. One of the calls for this program is:
>
>  XSetLineAttributes (widget->display,
>                        widget->gc,
>                        etc->zoom,
>                        widget->gc->values.line_style,
>                        widget->gc->values.cap_style,
>                        widget->gc->values.join_style);
>
