References: <1994Feb8.135543.15998@htl-bw.ch> <CKyy19.68y@acsu.buffalo.edu>
Date: Fri, 11 Feb 1994 18:03:37 GMT


I fixed the Cracker 4.1 on my DEC3000/300 with OSF/1 V1.3A.

In the file ./Sources/crack-supp.c in the procedure Log (...)
is a Line looking like

printf ("pwc: %-15.15s ", ctime(&t) + 4);


It seems that OSF/1 doesn't like the '+ 4' at the end.
So I changed the line to

printf ("pwc: %-19.19s ", ctime(&t));

And it worked.



Regard,

