you might want to add the line:

DisplayManager._0.terminateServer:      true

to your xdm-config to ensure the server gets killed at session exit and
the new session gets a new server.  Memory leaks shouldn't happen but
they do.  Also servers can get large if somebody views a lot of piccies.
You may also want to switch to 'lazy' swap if you run into this problem
a lot.  We do.

