Today I had a need to swap a running osf system from a DEC 3000/600 to
a 3000/300. The disks are external. After making a kernal that would boot 
on a 300, and changing the fstab entries so that the filesystems are mounted
from rz0 instead of rz8, I duly changed the disks over (After making a
