Actually, I found the per-file striping mechanism to be extrememly useful.
If you have 4 volumes in a domain, you have a choice as to how many of 
those you want to stripe on, 2,3 or 4.  And, you only have to stripe the
hot files if you desire.

: 4)  If you use advfs w/o lvm, I don't see anyway to do any mirroring, 
: except by doing some kind of evil "clonefset" or somesuch.  Seems weird
